{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bist Squad</strong> is a bite-sized 1-bit roguelite where you explore shifting dungeons, hatch mysterious eggs, and build a team of scrappy beasts to survive ever-tougher encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No tutorials. No handholding.</strong> Bist Squad trusts you to figure things out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1-bit pixel art visuals with a nostalgic, moody tone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based auto-battles with strategic team-building</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized dungeon layouts with different biome types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short play sessions (2\u20133 hours) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to form the ultimate Bist Squad?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3909710?t=1755945318","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3909710?t=1755945318","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909710/ba1e24c986a7925fe52a8a58b3917048273adc86/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755945318","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909710/ba1e24c986a7925fe52a8a58b3917048273adc86/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755945318","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bist Squad</strong> is a bite-sized 1-bit roguelite where you explore shifting dung